{
  "openapi": "3.0.4",
  "info": {
    "title": "Digital Product Passport API",
    "description": "## Overview\n\nDigital Product Passport (D3P) Platform is the overarching platform and software used to support all current and future 'Digital Passports' on JLR vehicles, including Battery Passport and EU7 Environmental Passport. \n\n## What is D3P API?\n\nThe API serves as a single source of truth for all digital passports. The platform will be responsible for providing data to any interested parties, including regulatory bodies.\n\n\n## Consumers\n\nEach vehicle will feature two QR codes:\n- B-Pillar QR Code: Links to the top-level Digital Product Passport portal for the vehicle\n- Battery QR Code: Links directly to the Battery Passport, as mandated by regulation\n\nAnyone scanning these QR codes, the API will return\n- Public Data: Which is accessible without authentication.\n- Sensitive Data: Requires secure login and role-based access control.\n- Portal UI: Designed for intuitive navigation and data exploration via a web browser(Desktop / Tablet / Mobile).\n\n## Datasources\nEnvironmental Passport data will be a subset of certificate of conformity (CoC) data.\nThe platform return pre ingested the data from various sources,\n- Engineering\n- IO\n- Commertial\n- Suppliers\n- etc.\n\n\n## Endpoints\n\n`https://api.dpp.jlr.com/vehicles/{VIN}`\n\n`https://api.dpp.jlr.com/battries/{serialNumber}`\n\nThe endpoint is provides passport information held at JLR end and it does not allow update to any of the files via this API.\n\n\n## Security and authorization\n\n The basic authentication method is used for accessing the APIGEE endpoints.\n\n## Region\n\n Currently, the accepted region values are EU and UK only.\n\n ## Environments \n\n Below are the current environments available for using the D3P  API. \n\n | Environment | URL |\n|-------------|-----|\n| Staging | `https://api.staging.dpp.jlr.com/vehicles` |\n| Pre Production | `https://api.pre-prod.dpp.jlr.com/vehicles` |\n| Production | `https://api.dpp.jlr.com/vehicles` |\n\n## Digital Onboarding\nTo provide a product or service on our platform, or use an existing API, you'll need to be approved.\nTo be approved, you'll need to supply some key information. Please refer to our [onboarding information](/docs/getting-started/onboarding).\n\nPlatform API Team - [`apideveloper_smb@jaguarlandrover.com`](mailto:apideveloper_smb@jaguarlandrover.com)\n\nCopyright (c) Jaguar Land Rover Ltd 2023. All rights reserved\n",
    "version": "1.5.1",
    "contact": {
      "name": "API Platform Team, Manchester DDC, Jaguar Land Rover Ltd.",
      "url": "https://api-docs.jlr-ddc.com",
      "email": "D3P-Team-Man-GRP@jaguarlandrover.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Apache 2.0",
      "url": "http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
    },
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/jlr-b17/digital-product-passport-api/1.5.1"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.staging.dpp.jlr.com",
      "description": "Staging"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.pre-prod.dpp.jlr.com",
      "description": "QA"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.dpp.jlr.com",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Digital Product Passport",
      "description": "Operations for retrieving Digital Product Passport data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Environmental Vehicle Passport",
      "description": "Operations for retrieving Environmental Passport data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Battery Passport",
      "description": "Operations for retrieving Battery Passport data."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/vehicles/{VIN}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Digital Product Passport"
        ],
        "operationId": "getDigitalPassportAssetsByVIN",
        "summary": "Get all digital passport asset for a VIN",
        "description": "Returns all digital assets (EVP, BP etc) associated with a given VIN.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/VIN"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of digilat assets",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DigitalPassportAssetResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/400BadRequestSearchResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/401UnauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/403ForbiddenResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/404NotFoundResponse"
          },
          "405": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/405MethodNotAllowedResponse"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/500InternalServerErrorResponse"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/502BadGatewayResponse"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/503ServiceUnavailableResponse"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/504ServiceUnavailableResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/passports/{passportId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Environmental Vehicle Passport"
        ],
        "operationId": "getEnvironmentalPassportByPassportId",
        "summary": "Get EVP data by passport id",
        "description": "Will be called from D3P UI api service, and returns Environmental Passport (EVP) data for a given passport id.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/passportId"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "EVP data retrieved successfully.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "description": "Caching policy for this response.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "public, max-age=300"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnvironmentalPassportResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid VIN.",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalid-serial": {
                    "value": {
                      "type": "https://api.example.com/errors/invalid-vin",
                      "title": "Invalid serial number format",
                      "status": 400,
                      "detail": "VIN must be 6\u201330 uppercase alphanumeric characters.",
                      "instance": "/vehicles/ABC#123"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "VIN not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "not-found": {
                    "value": {
                      "type": "https://api.example.com/errors/not-found",
                      "title": "Not Found",
                      "status": 404,
                      "detail": "No EVP data found for VIN 'SDHMA2A17PB255214'.",
                      "instance": "/environmental-passport/SDHMA2A17PB255214"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many requests.",
            "headers": {
              "Retry-After": {
                "description": "Seconds to wait before retrying.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/batteries/{serialNumber}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Battery Passport"
        ],
        "operationId": "getBatteryPassportByBatterySerialNumber",
        "summary": "Get battery passport data by serial number",
        "description": "Will be called from D3P UI and UI api service and returns Battery Passport (BP) data for a given battery serial nuber.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/serialNumber"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "BP data retrieved successfully.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "description": "Caching policy for this response.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "public, max-age=300"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BatteryPassportResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "parameters": {
      "VIN": {
        "name": "VIN",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Unique vehicle Identification number.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 6,
          "maxLength": 30,
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9-]+$"
        },
        "example": "SDHMA2A17PB255214"
      },
      "passportId": {
        "name": "passportId",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Unique environmental passport id.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9-]+$"
        },
        "example": "EVP-EU07-12345678"
      },
      "serialNumber": {
        "name": "serialNumber",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Unique battery serial number.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9-]+$"
        },
        "example": "LG1234567890"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "DigitalPassportAssetResponse": {
        "title": "Digital Passport Asset Response",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DigitalPassportAssets"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "OK"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "105445aa7843bc8bf206b12000100000"
          },
          "timeGenerated": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "2025-11-27T14:34:58+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "DigitalPassportAssets": {
        "properties": {
          "DigitalPassportAsset": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DigitalPassportAsset"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "DigitalPassportAsset": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "assetId",
          "assetType",
          "assetDescription",
          "vin"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "assetId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JLR Internal passport Id",
            "example": "EVP-EU07-12345678"
          },
          "assetType": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of passport",
            "example": "EVP or BAT"
          },
          "assetDescription": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Asset description",
            "example": "Environmental passport"
          },
          "vin": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "VIN (may be 17 characters).",
            "minLength": 11,
            "maxLength": 25,
            "example": "SDHMA2A17PB255214"
          }
        }
      },
      "EnvironmentalPassportResponse": {
        "title": "Environmental Passport Response",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnvironmentalPassport"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "OK"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "105445aa7843bc8bf206b12000100000"
          },
          "timeGenerated": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "2025-11-01T14:34:58+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "EnvironmentalPassport": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "passportId",
          "passportType",
          "approvalCertificateNumber",
          "dateApprovalGranted",
          "make",
          "vehicleIdentificationNumber",
          "dateOfManufacture",
          "commercialName",
          "maxNetPower",
          "exhaustEmissions",
          "co2Emissions",
          "fuelConsumption",
          "eletricConsumption",
          "pureEletricVehicle",
          "ovcHybirdEletricVehicle"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "passportId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JLR Internal passport Id",
            "example": "EVP-EU07-12345678"
          },
          "passportType": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of passport",
            "example": "EVP or BAT"
          },
          "approvalCertificateNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Approval certificate identifier.",
            "example": "111111111"
          },
          "dateApprovalGranted": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Date when approval was granted (DD-MM-YYYY).",
            "example": "27-07-2006"
          },
          "make": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Make (Trade name of manufacturer).",
            "example": "Land Rover"
          },
          "vehicleIdentificationNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "VIN (may be 17 characters).",
            "minLength": 11,
            "maxLength": 25,
            "example": "SDHMA2A17PB255214"
          },
          "dateOfManufacture": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Date of manufacture of Vehicle (DD-MM-YYYY).",
            "example": "12-07-2026"
          },
          "commercialName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Commercial name.",
            "example": "Range Rover Velar"
          },
          "pemsFamilyIdentifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Vehicle family identifier.",
            "example": "MS-0EM-XY"
          },
          "obmFamilyIdentifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Vehicle family identifier.",
            "example": "nnnnnnnnnnn-WW/xxxx"
          },
          "batteryDurabilityFamilyIdentifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Vehicle family identifier, if applicable.",
            "example": "Not applicable"
          },
          "maxNetPower": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MaximumPower"
          },
          "exhaustEmissions": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExhaustEmissions"
          },
          "co2Emissions": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Co2Emissions"
          },
          "fuelConsumption": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FuelConsumption"
          },
          "eletricConsumption": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ElectricEnergyConsumption"
          },
          "pureEletricVehicle": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PureElectricVehicleRange"
          },
          "ovcHybirdEletricVehicle": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OvcHybirdEletricVehicle"
          }
        }
      },
      "MaximumPower": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Maximum net power",
        "properties": {
          "internalCombustionEngine": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "string",
            "example": "118.0/5000 kW at min"
          },
          "eletricMotor": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "80 kW"
          }
        }
      },
      "ExhaustEmissions": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Pollutant emissions in mg/km, (WLTP highest values) or WHSC (EURO VI)",
        "properties": {
          "co": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "458.8 mg/km"
          },
          "thc": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "22.5 mg/km"
          },
          "nmhc": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "19.65 mg/km"
          },
          "nox": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "10.5 mg/km"
          },
          "thc+nox": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "32.5 mg/km"
          },
          "nh3": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "5.6 mg/km"
          },
          "particulates(mass)": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "0.355 mg/km"
          },
          "particles": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "3.76+E11 #/km"
          }
        }
      },
      "Co2Emissions": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "CO2 Emissions in g/km, WLTP values",
        "properties": {
          "low": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "329 g/km"
          },
          "medium": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "204 g/km"
          },
          "high": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "178 g/km"
          },
          "extraHigh": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "220 g/km"
          },
          "combined": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "218 g/km"
          }
        }
      },
      "FuelConsumption": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Fuel Consumption in l/km, WLTP values",
        "properties": {
          "low": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "12.6 l/km"
          },
          "medium": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "7.8 l/km"
          },
          "high": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "6.8 l/km"
          },
          "extraHigh": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "8.4 l/km"
          },
          "combined": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "8.3 l/km"
          }
        }
      },
      "ElectricEnergyConsumption": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Electric energy consumption in Wh/km,  WLTP values.",
        "properties": {
          "low": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "110 Wh/km"
          },
          "medium": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "130 Wh/km"
          },
          "high": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "160 Wh/km"
          },
          "extraHigh": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "220 Wh/km"
          },
          "city": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "189 Wh/km"
          },
          "combined": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "170 Wh/km"
          }
        }
      },
      "PureElectricVehicleRange": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Electric driving range in km",
        "properties": {
          "combined": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "756 km"
          },
          "city": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "850 km"
          }
        }
      },
      "OvcHybirdEletricVehicle": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Off-vehicle Charging Hybrid Electric Vehicle (OVC-HEV)",
        "properties": {
          "chargeSustainingCo2Emissions": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Co2Emissions"
          },
          "chargeSustainingFuelConsumption": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FuelConsumption"
          },
          "chargeDepletingCo2Emissions": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "Charge sustaining CO2 Emissions in g/km, WLTP values",
            "properties": {
              "combined": {
                "type": "number",
                "format": "float",
                "example": "218 g/km"
              }
            }
          },
          "chargeDepletingFuelConsumption": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "Charge depleting fuel consumption in l/km, WLTP values",
            "properties": {
              "combined": {
                "type": "number",
                "format": "float",
                "example": "7.5 l/km"
              }
            }
          },
          "eletricConsumption": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ElectricEnergyConsumption"
          },
          "weightedCombined": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "OVC-HEV WLTP weighted, combined values",
            "properties": {
              "co2Emissions": {
                "type": "number",
                "format": "float",
                "example": "34 g/km"
              },
              "fuelConsumption": {
                "type": "number",
                "format": "float",
                "example": "7.5 l/km"
              },
              "eletricConsumption": {
                "type": "number",
                "format": "float",
                "example": "195 Wh/km"
              }
            }
          },
          "equivalentAllEletricRange": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "example": "60 km"
          }
        }
      },
      "BatteryPassportResponse": {
        "title": "Battery Passport Response",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BatteryPassport"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "OK"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "105445aa7843bc8bf206b12000100000"
          },
          "timeGenerated": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "2025-11-01T14:34:58+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "BatteryPassport": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "serialNumber"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "serialNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Battery serial number",
            "example": "LG1234567890"
          }
        }
      },
      "ProblemDetails": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "RFC 7807 problem details object for error responses.",
        "required": [
          "title",
          "status"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "A URI reference that identifies the problem type."
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "A short, human-readable summary of the problem type."
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The HTTP status code generated by the origin server.",
            "minimum": 100,
            "maximum": 599
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "A human-readable explanation specific to this occurrence of the problem."
          },
          "issues": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "A list of issues that exist with the request. Note this is an extension that is supported by the RFC but specific to Advanced.",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "fieldName": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "The fieldname is invalid."
                },
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "This is an error."
                }
              }
            },
            "example": [
              {
                "fieldName": "VIN",
                "error": "The Vehicle Identification Number was not recognized as being in the correct format."
              }
            ]
          },
          "instance": {
            "type": "string",
